# The 1310 Series Hyper Hub (8mm REX Bore) as goBILDA sells it: the hub and its pinch bolts.
# Each is taken out of goBILDA's model of the whole of it (see 'motion/hub_hyper_8mmREX_model' in partcad.yaml),
# so each is where that model has it, and all of them are placed at the origin.
links:
  - part: motion/hub_hyper_8mmREX_hub
    name: hub
  - part: motion/hub_hyper_8mmREX_pinch_bolts
    name: pinch-bolts
